<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
    <key>items</key>
    <array>
        <dict>
            <key>cell</key><string>PSGroupCell</string>
            <key>label</key><string>液态玻璃 (WXGlass)</string>
            <key>footerText</key><string>玻璃层不接收触摸，从机制上不会影响键盘操作。参数对标 GlassSuiteX；改动后收起再呼出键盘生效。</string>
        </dict>
        <dict>
            <key>cell</key><string>PSSwitchCell</string>
            <key>default</key><true/>
            <key>defaults</key><string>com.banliren.wxglass</string>
            <key>key</key><string>enabled</string>
            <key>label</key><string>启用</string>
        </dict>

        <dict>
            <key>cell</key><string>PSGroupCell</string>
            <key>label</key><string>外观参数</string>
        </dict>
        <dict>
            <key>cell</key><string>PSSliderCell</string>
            <key>default</key><real>20</real>
            <key>defaults</key><string>com.banliren.wxglass</string>
            <key>key</key><string>blurRadius</string>
            <key>label</key><string>模糊强度 (pt)</string>
            <key>min</key><real>0</real>
            <key>max</key><real>60</real>
            <key>showValue</key><true/>
        </dict>
        <dict>
            <key>cell</key><string>PSSliderCell</string>
            <key>default</key><real>12</real>
            <key>defaults</key><string>com.banliren.wxglass</string>
            <key>key</key><string>edgeRefraction</string>
            <key>label</key><string>边缘折射 (pt)</string>
            <key>min</key><real>0</real>
            <key>max</key><real>30</real>
            <key>showValue</key><true/>
        </dict>
        <dict>
            <key>cell</key><string>PSSliderCell</string>
            <key>default</key><real>0.6</real>
            <key>defaults</key><string>com.banliren.wxglass</string>
            <key>key</key><string>glowStrength</string>
            <key>label</key><string>高光强度</string>
            <key>min</key><real>0</real>
            <key>max</key><real>1.0</real>
            <key>showValue</key><true/>
        </dict>
        <dict>
            <key>cell</key><string>PSSliderCell</string>
            <key>default</key><real>0.25</real>
            <key>defaults</key><string>com.banliren.wxglass</string>
            <key>key</key><string>baseColor</string>
            <key>label</key><string>底色浓度</string>
            <key>min</key><real>0</real>
            <key>max</key><real>1.0</real>
            <key>showValue</key><true/>
        </dict>

        <dict>
            <key>cell</key><string>PSGroupCell</string>
            <key>label</key><string>排障（没效果时打开）</string>
            <key>footerText</key><string>① 先开「诊断色带」：键盘顶部出现红黄绿彩条 = 插件已生效，只是玻璃参数太淡；完全没彩条 = 插件没注入或没找到键盘宿主。② 再开「强制启用」：若开完彩条出现，说明是进程识别漏了本进程。</string>
        </dict>
        <dict>
            <key>cell</key><string>PSSwitchCell</string>
            <key>default</key><false/>
            <key>defaults</key><string>com.banliren.wxglass</string>
            <key>key</key><string>debugBanner</string>
            <key>label</key><string>诊断色带（键盘顶部彩条）</string>
        </dict>
        <dict>
            <key>cell</key><string>PSSwitchCell</string>
            <key>default</key><false/>
            <key>defaults</key><string>com.banliren.wxglass</string>
            <key>key</key><string>forceAll</string>
            <key>label</key><string>强制启用（忽略进程识别）</string>
        </dict>

        <dict>
            <key>cell</key><string>PSGroupCell</string>
            <key>label</key><string>诊断</string>
            <key>footerText</key><string>若「键盘进程版本」为空或不一致，说明插件本体没加载到键盘进程。探针文件：/var/mobile/Documents/WXGlass/wxg_probe.txt</string>
        </dict>
        <dict>
            <key>cell</key><string>PSLinkCell</string>
            <key>label</key><string>运行状态自检</string>
            <key>detail</key><string>WXGlassDiagController</string>
            <key>isController</key><true/>
        </dict>
    </array>
</dict>
</plist>
